 "text": "The groa'ch is a Breton folk being of an evil turn, unlike the helpful gruagach. One tale tells of a boy and a girl promised to each other at birth who were left as orphans. When the boy Huarn set out to seek his fortune, his intended, Bellah, gave him three talismans.",
